{"strongs": "H2794", "word": "חָרַשׁ", "translit": "cho.resh", "root": "חרש", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "cut in, engrave, plough, devise", "definition": "I. [ חָרַשׁ ] verb cut in, engrave, plough, devise (Late Hebrew id., plough , so Eth Phoenician חרש , Aramaic (rare) חֲרַת engrave , cleave, plough , Arabic plough ) — Qal Perfect חָֽרְשׁוּ Ps 129:3 , חֲרַשְׁתֶּם Judg 14:18 ; Hos 10:13 Imperfect יַחֲרשׁ Isa 28:24 ; Prov 20:4 יַחֲרוֺשׁ Hos 10:11 + Amos 6:12 (see below); 2 masculine singular תַּחֲרשׁ Deut 22:10 ; Prov 3:29 Infinitive construct חֲרשׁ 1Sam 8:12 Participle חֹרֵשׁ Gen 4:22 + 5 t.; חוֺרֵשׁ Amos 9:13 plural חֹרְשִׁים Ps 129:3 , חֹרְשֵׁי Job 4:8 + 3 t., feminine plural absolute חֹרְשׁוֺת Job 1:14 passive חֲרוּשָׁה Jer 17:1 : — 1. cut in, engrave , of worker in metals נְחשֶׁת וּבַרְזֶל ׳ ח Gen 4:22 ( J ), נחשׁת ׳ ח 1Kgs 7:14 figurative עַללֿוּחַ לִבָּם ׳ ח Jer 17:1 engraved on the tablet of their heart . 2. plough , literally, human subject (animal usually with בְּ ), no object expressed 1Kgs 19:19 ; Deut 22:10 ; Isa 28:24 , so יַחֲרוֺשׁ בבקרים Amos 6:12 (but read probably יֵחָרֵשׁ בבקר יָם , see We and others); with accusative of congnate meaning with verb חֲרִישׁוֺ ׳ ח 1Sam 8:12 plough his ploughing (= do his ploughing ), Prov 20:4 figurative of Judah Hos 10:11 with ethical reference רֶשַׁע ׳ ח v Hos 10:13 (|| קצר ), אָוֶן ׳ ח Job 4:8 (|| זרע , קצר ); עַלגַּֿבִּי חָֽרְשׁוּ חֹרְשִׁים Ps 129:3 upon my back have ploughmen ploughed (figurative of oppression by wicked); חֹרֵשׁ = ploughman Isa 28:24 ; Amos 9:13 (|| קוֺצֵר ); ׳ ח with oxen subject only Job 1:14 . 3. devise (as one who works in, practises ), usually bad sense, object רָעָה Prov 3:29 , רַע Prov 6:14 מַחְשְׁבוֺת אָוֶן v Prov 6:18 , חֹרְשֵׁירַע Prov 12:20 ; Prov 14:22 but also חֹרְשֵׁי טוֺב v Prov 14:22 . Niph`al Imperfect 3 feminine singular צִיּוֺן שָׂדֶה תֵּחָרֵשׁ Mic 3:12 Zion, as a field she shall be ploughed = Jer 26:18 . Hiph`il Participle מַחֲרִישׁ רָעָה עַלֿ 1Sam 23:9 fabricating mischief against (see Dr , and compare We ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3181')\">BDB3181</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2790')\">H2790</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2794')\">H2794</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3180')\">BDB3180</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3182')\">BDB3182</entry></div><p> I. [<bdbheb>חָרַשׁ</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>cut in, engrave, plough, devise</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id., plough</highlight>, so Eth <placeholder2010/> Phoenician <bdbheb>חרש</bdbheb>, Aramaic (rare) <bdbheb>חֲרַת</bdbheb> <highlight>engrave</highlight>, <placeholder2011/> <highlight>cleave, plough</highlight>, Arabic <placeholder2012/> <highlight>plough</highlight>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>חָֽרְשׁוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 129:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"129\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"129\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,129,3)\">Ps 129:3</ref>, <bdbheb>חֲרַשְׁתֶּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 14:18\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(7,14,18)\">Judg 14:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hos 10:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,13)\">Hos 10:13</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יַחֲרשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,24)\">Isa 28:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 20:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,4)\">Prov 20:4</ref> <bdbheb>יַחֲרוֺשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 10:11\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,11)\">Hos 10:11</ref>+ <ref ref=\"Amos 6:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,6,12)\">Amos 6:12</ref> (see below); 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>תַּחֲרשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 22:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,10)\">Deut 22:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 3:29\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,29)\">Prov 3:29</ref> <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>חֲרשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 8:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,8,12)\">1Sam 8:12</ref> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>חֹרֵשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 4:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,22)\">Gen 4:22</ref> + 5 t.; <bdbheb>חוֺרֵשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 9:13\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,13)\">Amos 9:13</ref> plural <bdbheb>חֹרְשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 129:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"129\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"129\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,129,3)\">Ps 129:3</ref>, <bdbheb>חֹרְשֵׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 4:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,8)\">Job 4:8</ref> + 3 t., feminine plural absolute <bdbheb>חֹרְשׁוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 1:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,14)\">Job 1:14</ref> <highlight>passive</highlight> <bdbheb>חֲרוּשָׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 17:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,1)\">Jer 17:1</ref>: — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>cut in, engrave</highlight>, of worker in metals <bdbheb>נְחשֶׁת וּבַרְזֶל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 4:22\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(1,4,22)\">Gen 4:22</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>נחשׁת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:14\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,14)\">1Kgs 7:14</ref> figurative <bdbheb>עַללֿוּחַ לִבָּם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 17:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,1)\">Jer 17:1</ref> <highlight>engraved on the tablet of their heart</highlight>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>plough</highlight>, literally, human subject (animal usually with <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb>), no object expressed <ref ref=\"1Kgs 19:19\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(11,19,19)\">1Kgs 19:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 22:10\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(5,22,10)\">Deut 22:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 28:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,24)\">Isa 28:24</ref>, so <bdbheb>יַחֲרוֺשׁ בבקרים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 6:12\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(30,6,12)\">Amos 6:12</ref> (but read probably <bdbheb>יֵחָרֵשׁ בבקר יָם</bdbheb>, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> and others); with accusative of congnate meaning with verb <bdbheb>חֲרִישׁוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 8:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,8,12)\">1Sam 8:12</ref> <highlight>plough his ploughing</highlight> (= <highlight>do his ploughing</highlight>), <ref ref=\"Prov 20:4\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(20,20,4)\">Prov 20:4</ref> figurative of Judah <ref ref=\"Hos 10:11\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,11)\">Hos 10:11</ref> with ethical reference <bdbheb>רֶשַׁע</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Hos 10:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,10,13)\">Hos 10:13</ref> (|| <bdbheb>קצר</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>אָוֶן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 4:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,8)\">Job 4:8</ref> (|| <bdbheb>זרע</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>קצר</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>עַלגַּֿבִּי חָֽרְשׁוּ חֹרְשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 129:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"129\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"129\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,129,3)\">Ps 129:3</ref> <highlight>upon my back have ploughmen ploughed</highlight> (figurative of oppression by wicked); <bdbheb>חֹרֵשׁ</bdbheb> = <highlight>ploughman</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:24\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,24)\">Isa 28:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 9:13\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,13)\">Amos 9:13</ref> (|| <bdbheb>קוֺצֵר</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> with oxen subject only <ref ref=\"Job 1:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,1,14)\">Job 1:14</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>devise</highlight> (as one who <highlight>works in, practises</highlight>), usually bad sense, object <bdbheb>רָעָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 3:29\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,29)\">Prov 3:29</ref>, <bdbheb>רַע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 6:14\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,14)\">Prov 6:14</ref> <bdbheb>מַחְשְׁבוֺת אָוֶן</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Prov 6:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,18)\">Prov 6:18</ref>, <bdbheb>חֹרְשֵׁירַע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 12:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,12,20)\">Prov 12:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 14:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,22)\">Prov 14:22</ref> but also <bdbheb>חֹרְשֵׁי טוֺב</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Prov 14:22\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(20,14,22)\">Prov 14:22</ref>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>צִיּוֺן שָׂדֶה תֵּחָרֵשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Mic 3:12\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(33,3,12)\">Mic 3:12</ref> Zion, as a field she <highlight>shall be ploughed</highlight> = <ref ref=\"Jer 26:18\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(24,26,18)\">Jer 26:18</ref>. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Participle</highlight> <bdbheb>מַחֲרִישׁ רָעָה עַלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 23:9\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(9,23,9)\">1Sam 23:9</ref> <highlight>fabricating mischief against</highlight> (see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr</lookup>, and compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ps 129:3", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 129, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Judg 14:18", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 14, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Hos 10:13", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 10, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Isa 28:24", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 28, "verse": 24}, {"raw": "Prov 20:4", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 20, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Hos 10:11", "book": "HOS", "chapter": 10, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Amos 6:12", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 6, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Deut 22:10", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 22, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Prov 3:29", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 3, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "1Sam 8:12", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 8, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Gen 4:22", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 4, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Amos 9:13", "book": "AMO", "chapter": 9, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Job 4:8", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 4, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "Job 1:14", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 1, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Jer 17:1", "book": "JER", "chapter": 17, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "1Kgs 7:14", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 7, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "1Kgs 19:19", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 19, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Prov 6:14", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 6, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Prov 6:18", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 6, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Prov 12:20", "book": "PRO", "chapter": 12, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Prov